Package: staleness
Type: Package
Title: Detect and Calibrate Out-of-Date Meta-Analyses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Javier", "Núñez", email = "jnverbel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Applies the five published statistical methods for detecting whether a
    systematic review or meta-analysis has gone out of date, and provides a
    backtesting engine to calibrate those methods against historical evidence.
    Methods implemented follow Shojania and colleagues (2007) <doi:10.7326/0003-4819-147-4-200708210-00179>
    and the comparative evaluation of updating signals in the evidence synthesis
    literature. The package performs no literature searching and no screening.
URL: https://github.com/jnverbel/staleness
BugReports: https://github.com/jnverbel/staleness/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-GB
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: metafor, stats, graphics
Suggests: metadat, testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, grDevices, withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
